# Dual Date Picker (BS/AD) Implementation - COMPLETED

## Files Created:

### 1. PHP Component Class
**Location:** `app/View/Components/DualDatePicker.php`
- Accepts parameters: name, id, label, value, required, helpText, placeholder, defaultMode
- Integrates with NepaliContentHelper for BS/AD conversions
- Calculates current BS year/month for initialization

### 2. Blade View Component
**Location:** `resources/views/components/dual-date-picker.blade.php`
- Toggle switch (BS | AD) for calendar mode selection
- Hidden input storing AD date (YYYY-MM-DD) for Laravel forms
- Calendar popup with month navigation and weekday headers in Nepali
- "Today" and "Clear" buttons
- BS date displayed by default with AD preview
- TailwindCSS styling matching project design

### 3. JavaScript File
**Location:** `resources/js/dual-date-picker.js`
- Full BS calendar data (2070-2090 BS) with accurate month lengths
- BS ↔ AD date conversion utilities
- Nepali number utilities (Devanagari numerals)
- Date picker state management and calendar rendering
- Date selection with auto-conversion between calendars

## Usage Example:
```blade
{{-- Basic usage --}}
<x-dual-date-picker name="attendance_date" label="Attendance Date" required />

{{-- With initial value --}}
<x-dual-date-picker 
    name="exam_date" 
    label="Exam Date" 
    :value="old('exam_date', $exam->exam_date)"
    defaultMode="bs"
/>

{{-- AD mode --}}
<x-dual-date-picker 
    name="birth_date" 
    label="Birth Date (AD)" 
    defaultMode="ad"
/>
```

## Key Features:
- ✅ Toggle between Bikram Sambat (BS) and Gregorian (AD) calendars
- ✅ BS calendar shows accurate Nepali dates (2070-2090 BS range)
- ✅ Hidden input stores AD date (YYYY-MM-DD) for Laravel forms
- ✅ Displays dates in BS format by default
- ✅ Seamless BS ↔ AD conversion when switching modes
- ✅ Nepali numbers (Devanagari) for BS dates
- ✅ TailwindCSS styling matching existing project design
- ✅ Bootstrap Icons integration

